    "description": "When you select this Talent, choose one <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained_Skill\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained Skill\">Trained Skill</a>. Whenever you roll a Natural 19 or a Natural 20 on a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill Check\">Skill Check</a> with that <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill\">Skill</a>, you gain the benefits of the <b>Critical Skill Success</b> Talent and also gain <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Hit Points\">Bonus Hit Points</a> equal to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> modifier. You can select this Talent multiple times. Each time you do so, you must choose a different <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill\">Skill</a> to gain the benefits of this Talent.",
